  "title": "Easy Rhubarb Pudding Cake",
  "description": "A very simple rhubarb pudding-bottom cake starting with boxed cake mix. Its gooey base has nostalgic upside-down cake qualities with a sweet-tart flavor.",
  "authors": [
    "Michelle Peterson"
  ],
